; Stage 15 W5f: an empty list `()` in a `(union ...)` member position reads as a
; NULL node. Before W5f the anonymous-union member loop dereferenced it and the
; compiler segfaulted with no output at all. It must be a located diagnostic.
;
; (This is also the shape the W5f crash arrived in: `acv:(fn void)()` used to
; leave the `()` dangling as a separate member. That spelling now fuses into the
; function-pointer type, so only a genuinely stray `()` reaches here.)

(defstruct Row
  tics:i32
  (action (union as-int:i64 ())))

(defn main ():i32 (return 0))
